{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000033:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "LIVE当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46695c9cf7e7f4860b52b49cd23692e9c57a1f41648c7aaeaa2d5c4f0f0905d0",
      "text": "是315 Production的大巴对吧。\n能否请在这边的停车场稍作等待？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f8d1c6e60e1c742b789bd5c817bd8aeff93ebf47015817319f9ff7af562a95",
      "text": "实际上现场还没做好接纳相关人员的准备……\n请在这里再待命30分钟，不，40分钟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52a4b5f777c15f767e5ced778f3b97298d4dcfd56ff81f2fca82527e1e446575",
      "text": "哎哎，怎么这样！\n这可怎么办啊，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc6d6d9a328aedaa7d58a285ec1174079025631f47a038c76a23e68de4083e80",
      "text": "这下伤脑筋了呢。\n本来前面的路就容易堵车……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4401e0c4d6bb3351b763c91acb1ac42b43a23b28f5643396b5ab250ad37c9937",
      "text": "（但是……不管被拖延多少分钟都没问题。\n因为这辆大巴，只是诱饵而已！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284359ff83c10ad0fe01e6ed751c2c53a10db2b1c54c7840739483599bf4c357",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー来联络了！\n看来315 Pro的大巴果然被拦住了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e51226af19f219f55bf9d37801ca4a69d8bf38a162d527428ad8892e4a29356",
      "text": "不过按计划，他们俩替我们引开了敌人的视线。\n趁现在，我们赶去舞台那边吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec3dba1e5f95ebe696c55ae0740e1e9451d8beed28fe1df91325ea937eb0100e",
      "text": "接下来是转弯处啊。\n硲先生，后面没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4023c51c6729b87c283c1a97ba972d53cebdd829f2a2cea33d4076c4645ca405",
      "text": "嗯，没有问题。\n葛之叶君，安全驾驶技术真漂亮！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f201e918e077e8e2390f4417bf7b69a9bdddddcf616f3187aca8572829e5098e",
      "text": "次郎，没事吧？\n对对，抓紧我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d0dcb45720ed9d499cf1ad759f7d7a592259a506405a0df68a5d7225c3f828",
      "text": "明明道路拥堵，而且还绕了远路，\n却一直在不断靠近会场呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baa0ecd7d5843273708a2fe6c3c1acbc550b66a95bf88f0b0ec0feefcb752cd2",
      "text": "呵呵。首先第一关，突破了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
